zscalerctl CLI surface map
  version:   <VERSION>
  introspect-version: 2
  read-only: true
  schema:    https://raw.githubusercontent.com/dvmrry/zscalerctl/main/docs/schema/introspect-v2.schema.json

Global flags (13):
  --color (string, default "auto")  color output: auto, always, never
  --config (string)  config file path
  --fields (string)  comma-separated output fields to keep (narrows the sanitized output)
  --filter (stringArray)  narrow list results: key=value (exact) or key~value (substring); repeatable, all must match
  --format (string, default "auto")  output format: auto, table, json, ndjson, pretty
  --log-level (string, default "off")  diagnostic logging to stderr: off, error, warn, info, debug
  --no-cache (bool, default "false")  bypass API cache where supported
  --no-color (bool, default "false")  disable color output
  --output (string)  create or replace an output file (not valid with dump)
  --profile (string)  profile name
  --redaction (string)  redaction mode: standard, share, paranoid
  --search (string)  narrow list results to records whose rendered values contain term (case-insensitive)
  --timeout (duration, default "30s")  request timeout

Effect conditions: unqualified = always; --flag = flag-conditioned;
  configuration-dependent = effective config/provider/platform may enable it.

Commands (292):
  auth                                      inspect authentication configuration
      effects: local_filesystem_write (when --output is set)
  auth status                               show authentication status for the active profile
      effects: local_filesystem_read (configuration-dependent), local_filesystem_write (when --output is set)
  completion                                Generate the autocompletion script for the specified shell
      effects: local_filesystem_write (when --output is set)
  completion bash                           Generate the autocompletion script for bash
      effects: local_filesystem_write (when --output is set)
      --no-descriptions (bool, default "false")
  completion fish                           Generate the autocompletion script for fish
      effects: local_filesystem_write (when --output is set)
      --no-descriptions (bool, default "false")
  completion powershell                     Generate the autocompletion script for powershell
      effects: local_filesystem_write (when --output is set)
      --no-descriptions (bool, default "false")
  completion zsh                            Generate the autocompletion script for zsh
      effects: local_filesystem_write (when --output is set)
      --no-descriptions (bool, default "false")
  config                                    manage zscalerctl configuration
      effects: local_filesystem_write (when --output is set)
  config init                               write a starter config file with owner-only permissions
      effects: local_filesystem_delete (when --force is set), local_filesystem_write, local_filesystem_write (when --output is set), process_execution (configuration-dependent)
      --force (bool, default "false")
  config show                               show the active configuration (redacted)
      effects: local_filesystem_read (configuration-dependent), local_filesystem_write (when --output is set)
  diff                                      compare two dump directories and report configuration drift
      effects: local_filesystem_read, local_filesystem_write (when --output is set)
      --allow-partial (bool, default "false")
      --detail (bool, default "false")
      --fail-on-drift (bool, default "false")
      --ignore-operational (bool, default "false")
      --products (string)
      --resources (string)
  doctor                                    check configuration, credentials, and connectivity
      effects: local_filesystem_read (configuration-dependent), local_filesystem_write (when --output is set)
  dump                                      write a full or filtered resource dump to a directory
      effects: local_filesystem_delete (when --force is set), local_filesystem_read (configuration-dependent), local_filesystem_read (when --force is set), local_filesystem_write, network_access, process_execution (configuration-dependent)
      --continue-on-error (bool, default "false")
      --force (bool, default "false")
      --out (string)
      --products (string)
      --resources (string)
  help                                      Help about any command
      effects: local_filesystem_write (when --output is set)
  introspect                                print a machine-readable map of all commands, flags, and resources (JSON)
      effects: local_filesystem_write (when --output is set)
  machine                                   inspect machine-readable capability contracts
      effects: local_filesystem_write (when --output is set)
  machine manifest                          print the machine capability manifest
      effects: local_filesystem_write (when --output is set)
  schema                                    inspect the resource catalog schema
      effects: local_filesystem_write (when --output is set)
  schema list                               list all catalog resources and their supported operations
      effects: local_filesystem_read (configuration-dependent), local_filesystem_write (when --output is set)
  version                                   print version, commit, build date, and runtime info
      effects: local_filesystem_write (when --output is set)
